#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:5
#: b16c6da4b46547bca8cad6334fde1c34
msgid "ESP8266 wifi telemetry"
msgstr "ESP8266 WiFi 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:19
#: 6e975a8f8d9e4498bd25d169e1cd3217
msgid ""
"The ESP8266 wifi module is an inexpensive programmable wifi modules "
"available from many sources.  It also comes included with most "
":ref:`Pixracers <common-pixracer-overview>`."
msgstr ""
"ESP8266 WiFi 模块是一种价格低廉的可编程 WiFi 模块，可从多种渠道购买。大多数 :ref:`Pixracer <common-"
"pixracer-overview>` 也随附该模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:22
#: 6d880332be884a32a0032411a33089ea
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:23
#: ff7afd62a7774b9fb035944392f7b1c8
msgid ""
"The `adafruit HUZZAH ESP8266 breakout board "
"<https://www.adafruit.com/product/2471>`__ can be connected to an autopilot "
"without the need for 3.3V regulator or level shifters."
msgstr ""
"`Adafruit HUZZAH ESP8266 扩展板 <https://www.adafruit.com/product/2471>`__ 无需 "
"3.3V 稳压器或电平转换器即可连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:24
#: 4c868942a0014a72b5ed293994bb97c0
msgid ""
"The `Beyond Robotix - Kahuna "
"<https://www.beyondrobotix.com/products/kahuna>`__ is a ready to use ESP8266"
" module that connects directly to an autopilot. The Kahuna is pre-flashed "
"with a fork of ArduPilot firmware, has a JST-GH connector to connect easily "
"to several off-the-shelf autopilots and has a u.fl connector for an external"
" antenna. Further documentation for this unit is found `here "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VyOsp9_q6dIAdYdWuDFcWoqqrNy_vbFMANubZA3Uz5g/edit?usp=sharing>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Beyond Robotix - Kahuna <https://www.beyondrobotix.com/products/kahuna>`__ "
"是一款可直接连接飞控的即用型 ESP8266 模块。Kahuna 预刷了 ArduPilot 固件分支，配备 JST-GH "
"连接器可轻松连接多款市售飞控，并配有 u.fl 外置天线接头。更多文档可在 `此处 "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VyOsp9_q6dIAdYdWuDFcWoqqrNy_vbFMANubZA3Uz5g/edit?usp=sharing>`__"
" 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:25
#: b44d6f9e13bb43c498f207f968244e67
msgid ""
"`AeroLink:WiFi from Bask Aerospace "
"<https://baskaerospace.com.au/shop/telemetry/aerolink-wifi/>`__ is a ready "
"to use ESP8266 module that connects directly to an autopilot through a "
"Serial Port. The AeroLink:WiFi is pre-flashed with a fork of ArduPilot "
"ESP8266 firmware, has a JST-GH connector to connect easily to several off-"
"the-shelf autopilots and has a built-in antenna. Further documentation the "
"AeroLink:WiFi see the `Manual "
"<https://baskaerospace.com.au/support/manual/aerolink-wifi-user-manual/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Bask Aerospace 的 AeroLink:WiFi "
"<https://baskaerospace.com.au/shop/telemetry/aerolink-wifi/>`__ "
"是一款可通过串口直接连接飞控的即用型 ESP8266 模块。AeroLink:WiFi 预刷了 ArduPilot ESP8266 固件分支，配备 "
"JST-GH 连接器可轻松连接多款市售飞控，并内置天线。更多文档请参阅 `手册 "
"<https://baskaerospace.com.au/support/manual/aerolink-wifi-user-manual/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:28
#: 3c8a1d29746a450887bb5f98ee6b34f1
msgid "Connecting to an autopilot"
msgstr "连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:33
#: e80cd306f14c411abba5a2ee8ae30551
msgid ""
"If connected to Serial1/Telem1 these parameters should be set on the "
"autopilot (if using another telemetry port, replace the \"1\" in the "
"parameter name with the telemetry port's number):"
msgstr "如果连接到 Serial1/Telem1，飞控上应设置以下参数（如果使用其他数传端口，请将参数名中的 「1」 替换为对应数传端口编号）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:35
#: 86ad55809bf9466fa8da470f385b773c
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2) or 1 (MAVLink1)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 2（MAVLink2）或 1（MAVLink1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:36
#: 937e91d2d9bc4a4ebf8943807ba740fd
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 921（921600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:38
#: 97ad122a91304aee9450d1cff6ff9aa5
msgid ""
"If you have problems connecting, it may help to set :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS "
"<BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` = 0 to disable flow control although this is not normally"
" necessary"
msgstr ""
"如果连接遇到问题，可以尝试将 :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` = 0 以禁用流控，虽然通常不必要"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:41
#: 162ed16194ae4c5e982a197492cc9311
msgid "Connecting from a Ground Station"
msgstr "从地面站连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:43
#: 5ca8edac49354f22b6b0b9d7b622a1e8
msgid ""
"load the MAVESP8266 firmware to the device if you haven't already (see "
"below)"
msgstr "如果尚未完成，请将 MAVESP8266 固件烧录到设备（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:44
#: 0818bb5ae5df4e20b59d54bc2055e5bd
msgid ""
"on your PC, open the wifi network connections screen and select the wifi "
"access point (SSID \"ArduPilot\" or \"PixRacer\" with a lower case password "
"\"ardupilot\" or \"pixracer\" respectively)"
msgstr ""
"在电脑上打开 WiFi 网络连接界面，选择 WiFi 热点（SSID 「ArduPilot」 或 「PixRacer」，密码分别为小写的 "
"「ardupilot」 或 「pixracer」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:45
#: 9e13095f061f47419532840072569b22
msgid ""
"on the ground station, set the connection type to UDP and press \"Connect\""
msgstr "在地面站中，将连接类型设置为 UDP 并点击「连接」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:47
#: bd25d98b70944c33b252e409c6e24fe1
msgid ""
"If all is well the ground station will connect, download parameters and the "
"HUD should move as the vehicle is moved."
msgstr "如果一切正常，地面站将连接、下载参数，且 HUD 会随飞行器移动而变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:50
#: 3f5faa27384f4390a0f4d8e6582f758c
