msgstr ""
"我们推荐烧录 ArduPilot 特定版本的 MAVESP8266（`二进制文件 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/>`__，`源码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavesp8266>`__），而非原版 `MAVESP8266 "
"<https://github.com/dogmaphobic/mavesp8266>`__，因为它包含两项额外功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:54
#: 86d3f848eb1c4cd78f0ed584ddd78e8b
msgid "mavlink2 support"
msgstr "支持 MAVLink2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:55
#: 0ad5ee2b686f40c48aef847f0ddbbc50
msgid "subsequent firmware uploads can be done over wifi"
msgstr "后续固件升级可通过 WiFi 进行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:56
#: 9bb6b0481c9848c2b19d56faca273561
msgid "simple configuration web interface"
msgstr "简洁的配置 Web 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:58
#: ab2a84227b524f398306fafc0a04b6df
msgid ""
"An `FTDI Cable like this one from SparkFun "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9717>`__ is required for at least the "
"first time the firmware is upload to the device."
msgstr ""
"至少在第一次向设备烧录固件时需要使用 `类似 SparkFun 这款的 FTDI 线缆 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9717>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:60
#: 59077825b3774f30a6edac463d058db9
msgid ""
"If you are using the Adafruit HUZZAH ESP8266 board and are flashing from a "
"Windows PC then you should:"
msgstr "如果您使用 Adafruit HUZZAH ESP8266 开发板并从 Windows 电脑烧录，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:62
#: 5bca5b0cddc54d39a4e5d84406bb4396
msgid ""
"solder a 6pin header to the narrow end of the board that has the TX, RX, VCC"
" and GND pins"
msgstr "在板卡窄端焊接一个 6 针排针，该端有 TX、RX、VCC 和 GND 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:63
#: c2530b3a0d0746e89677ceb49e952002
msgid "connect the device to your computer using the FTDI cable"
msgstr "使用 FTDI 线缆将设备连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:64
#: 273629a266a146bfaf5cf9e9df4d34ea
msgid ""
"put the device into bootloader mode by pressing both the Reset and GPIO0 "
"buttons, then release the Reset button followed by the GPIO0 button.  the "
"red LED should remain dimly lit."
msgstr ""
"通过同时按下 Reset 和 GPIO0 按钮进入引导加载程序模式，然后先松开 Reset 按钮，再松开 GPIO0 按钮。红色 LED 应保持微亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:65
#: b2de73b2176c4a818eff8ef5b7f27332
msgid ""
"download the ArduPilot specific version of MAVESP8266 from `this directory "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/>`__"
msgstr ""
"从 `此目录 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/>`__ 下载 "
"ArduPilot 特定版本的 MAVESP8266"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:67
#: 956ea2543e9a46ae9b71e77afe147962
msgid ""
"`firmware-esp01_1m.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp01_1m.bin>`__ is for boards with 1MB of flash (most boards)"
msgstr ""
"`firmware-esp01_1m.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp01_1m.bin>`__ 适用于闪存为 1MB 的开发板（大多数开发板）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:68
#: 083ee02022ab458da7359ba4d186d5de
msgid ""
"`firmware-esp01.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp01.bin>`__ is for boards with only 512KB of flash (very old boards)"
msgstr ""
"`firmware-esp01.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp01.bin>`__ 适用于闪存仅 512KB 的开发板（非常老旧的开发板）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:69
#: 489ab0b81cd649558bb42a49a1ca3993
msgid ""
"`firmware-esp12e.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp12e.bin>`__ is for boards with 4MB of flash"
msgstr ""
"`firmware-esp12e.bin "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVESP8266/latest/firmware-"
"esp12e.bin>`__ 适用于闪存为 4MB 的开发板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:70
#: c449f7daa2544778b883d22f7a409008
msgid ""
"Windows users should download and run the NodeMCU flasher (`64bit "
"<https://github.com/nodemcu/nodemcu-"
"flasher/blob/master/Win64/Release/ESP8266Flasher.exe>`__ or `32bit "
"<https://github.com/nodemcu/nodemcu-"
"flasher/blob/master/Win32/Release/ESP8266Flasher.exe>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Windows 用户应下载并运行 NodeMCU 烧录工具（`64位 <https://github.com/nodemcu/nodemcu-"
"flasher/blob/master/Win64/Release/ESP8266Flasher.exe>`__ 或 `32位 "
"<https://github.com/nodemcu/nodemcu-"
"flasher/blob/master/Win32/Release/ESP8266Flasher.exe>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:72
#: 780a3eba72224f1b8139a5c382a82bd1
msgid "on the Advanced page ensure the Flash size is set to 4MByte"
msgstr "在「高级」页面确保闪存大小设置为 4MB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:73
#: dc8cc42cfca14ca98ae9349def2a16e1
msgid ""
"on the Config page push the gear and select the firmware downloaded above"
msgstr "在「配置」页面点击齿轮图标并选择上面下载的固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:74
#: def015ea3e1d49a0ad01b43468cb3a55
msgid ""
"on the Operation page select the \"COM Port\" and push the \"Flash\" button."
"  If successful the blue bar will slowly stretch from left to right and the "
"icon on the bottom left will turn green."
msgstr "在「操作」页面选择「COM 端口」并点击「烧录」按钮。如果烧录成功，蓝色进度条将从左向右缓慢延伸，左下角图标将变为绿色。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:79
#: aaf475e3e0844461b8ff06d190875114
msgid ""
"Mac users should use the `esptool <https://github.com/espressif/esptool>`__"
msgstr "Mac 用户应使用 `esptool <https://github.com/espressif/esptool>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:81
#: 640c8f1e251d42c092d87efc2194a64c
msgid ""
"First, find the COM of your connected device by using the following command "
"line in the terminal. The USB COM port that the ESP8266 is attached will "
"appear something  \"/dev/ttyusbserial-A600eto2\""
msgstr ""
"首先，在终端中使用以下命令找到已连接设备的 COM 端口。ESP8266 所连接的 USB COM 端口显示为类似 "
"「/dev/ttyusbserial-A600eto2」 的形式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:87
#: e1edb6e33eca4a5bba69891b1d73a4bf
msgid ""
"Next, you need to erase all content in your ESP8266. Put the ESP8266 in "
"bootloader mode, and run this command in your terminal window, replacing the"
" *COM* with the ESP8266 COM port you found previously above"
msgstr ""
"接下来，需要清除 ESP8266 中的所有内容。将 ESP8266 置于引导加载程序模式，然后在终端窗口中运行以下命令，将 *COM* 替换为上面找到的"
" ESP8266 COM 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:93
#: 6964f826b17c4b7c96ace816db46ac8a
msgid ""
"Finally,  flash the board with the correct expected firmware: Put your "
"device in bootloader mode again, and use the following command, again "
"replacing the *COM* with the  port you used in the previous command."
msgstr "最后，用正确的固件烧录开发板：再次将设备置于引导加载程序模式，使用以下命令，同样将 *COM* 替换为上一命令中使用的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:101
#: d6fb40e9db0444e69f228eb3c0ece6b8
msgid ""
"Linux users should use the `esptool "
"<https://github.com/espressif/esptool>`__"
msgstr "Linux 用户应使用 `esptool <https://github.com/espressif/esptool>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:104
#: be0663efdf1c4cd8835613d167ba8095
msgid "Changing the Wifi SSID and Password"
msgstr "更改 WiFi SSID 和密码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:106
#: 5c09c6297ae84470a7622595b40aec1d
msgid ""
"connect from your PC to the wifi access point (initial access point ID is "
"\"ArduPilot\", and password is \"ardupilot\")"
msgstr "从电脑连接到 WiFi 热点（初始热点 ID 为 「ArduPilot」，密码为 「ardupilot」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:107
#: 8caec8b9fd3a469598971c22c4f70fd7
msgid ""
"open a browser to `192.168.4.1 <http://192.168.4.1/>`__ and a simple web "
"interface will appear like below"
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 `192.168.4.1 <http://192.168.4.1/>`__，将出现如下简单的 Web 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:108
#: ded3c563a5cc40dc831a9ee4f039d3a4
msgid "click on the \"Setup\" link"
msgstr "点击「设置」链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:109
#: 541ccf7e8ec8401bb23c48e71800dc87
msgid ""
"set the \"AP SSID\" and \"AP Password\" fields (both must be between 8 and "
"16 characters), push the \"Save\" button and reboot the device"
msgstr "设置「AP SSID」和「AP 密码」字段（均须为 8 到 16 个字符），点击「保存」按钮并重启设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp8266-telemetry.rst:114
#: 84ff8847195744b29c049f1683dfd4da
msgid ""
"Thanks to `Ray's blog <https://rays-blog.de/2016/10/21/224/adding-wi-fi-"
"telemetry-to-pixhawk-flight-controller-with-esp8266-module/>`__ which was "
"the source for some of this page's advice."
msgstr ""
"感谢 `Ray 的博客 <https://rays-blog.de/2016/10/21/224/adding-wi-fi-telemetry-to-"
